                                                "sense_id": "b4342415-4835-37f8-a36e-8b09980edce1",
                                                "text": "December 8. . . . A precatory letter from Gillies. I must do Molière for him, I suppose; but it is wonderful that knowing the situation I am in, the poor fellow presses so hard."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
